# The vendored frozen algorithm code must check out BYTE-IDENTICALLY on every
# platform. Without `-text`, core.autocrlf rewrites line endings on checkout, so a
# Linux deploy would produce different bytes than the Windows working copy and the
# hashes in config.CASCADE_SRC_MD5 — the published integrity record — would no
# longer match. Store and restore these files verbatim.
cascade_src/** -text

# Frozen model artifacts: md5-gated at load time, never line-ending converted.
*.pkl binary
